2. During the first 180 days, Ceciliaa uses 110 cups out of her bag (the whole bag), so the remaining dog food needed for the first 180 days is the amount calculated earlier minus the cups provided by the whole bag:

   180 cups - 110 cups = \boxed{70 cups}

